ss(you know... the pirate sword). And she likes rum. so you can draw her in little drunken condition if you want. \n\nMost of all, she has a flower on her left eye as an eyepatch. I will give you some reference files about it. The name of files would be 'Eye flower reference 1~3'. The color of flower is cherry blossom color. I will leave the shape of flower up to you.\n \nI will leave her facial expression, the pose, the background… all up to you. \n\nThank you fore reading this. Have a nice day!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1PxYMzMZlgayZqVdMsR1yn1ifqpw9TJuo?usp=sharing", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@U_ISUZU/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 374230, "client_id": 17358, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/6d8ce3c7/requests/232198_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f85f4f07729206a245822655e61511eb", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6d8ce3c7/requests/232198_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f85f4f07729206a245822655e61511eb, https://si.imgix.net/6d8ce3c7/requests/232198_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ee301b4d32620005c59d6fed4e690479 2x, https://si.imgix.net/6d8ce3c7/requests/232198_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e381961c3c8c61449de0eb124f0e0c30 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/6d8ce3c7/requests/232198_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=af9c3a8836d2888877337ecf6d367f24", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6d8ce3c7/requests/232198_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=af9c3a8836d2888877337ecf6d367f24, https://si.imgix.net